<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal BDP trade interrupted due technical probs.</title>
<headline>Portugal BDP trade interrupted due technical probs.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) interrupted trade to technical problems, an BDP official said.</p>
<p>&quot;Trade is interrupted due to communications problems. We don't yet know when trade can resume,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
